Scope of this licence

The MIT licence above covers the source code and the documentation written for
this repository. It does NOT cover:

* Fonts in analysis/policy_paper_ro/fonts/ (IBM Plex Sans, IBM Plex Mono,
  Source Serif 4). They remain under the SIL Open Font License 1.1; see
  OFL-IBM-Plex.txt and OFL-Source-Serif-4.txt in that folder.

* Data. Third-party data keep the terms of their sources (see docs/DATA.md):
  - Ministry of Finance balance sheets (data.gov.ro, "situatii_financiare_2024"
    and "situatii_financiare_2025"): Creative Commons Attribution 4.0.
  - BERC / ONRC publications and the myportal sample: terms set by ONRC and
    the applicable Romanian law; they are NOT relicensed here.
  - Official figures quoted from public documents (Ministry of Justice notes,
    legislation, Eurostat, BNR, World Bank): terms of each source.
  Aggregated outputs produced by the scripts in this repository may be reused
  with attribution to the author and to the original data sources.
